  "notes": "Perplexity used only the API ids (sonar-small-chat, sonar-small-online, sonar-medium-chat, sonar-medium-online) and called them its latest Perplexity models; the name is an editorial disambiguation from the later Sonar model of January 2025. The model cards captured on 2024-03-01 also mention sonar-1-small-online and sonar-1-medium-online in a note; those ids are not documented elsewhere and are not recorded. Perplexity does not name the base models, only the parameter counts 7B and 8x7B. The May 2024 notice pairs pplx-7b-chat/pplx-7b-online with sonar-small and pplx-8x7b-chat/pplx-8x7b-online with sonar-medium among models and model name aliases; the pplx-8x7b ids are not recorded. The February 2024 post URL now redirects to the general changelog, which no longer carries the entry; the archived copy is used."
